      "content": "it's not just stress though. i can feel the pieces slipping. it's like watching a movie of my own life but the screen is getting static and blurry. i don't want to wait until i'm just sitting in a chair staring at a wall, not even knowing who the people in the photos are. i just want to leave before the \"me\" part is totally gone. i want to leave while i still know who i am.",
